── INHERENT METHOD HIDES A TRAIT METHOD ── E0308_inherent_method_hides_a_trait_method.lt:7:1  [E0308]

`Point` has an inherent method `show`, which this impl of `Show` would hide;
rename one:

  7 │ impl Show for Point {
    │ ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

A method's name means one member of a type, so an inherent method and a trait's
method can't share it. Rename the inherent method.
